# Real statements stay local. This repo is published via GitHub Pages, which
# serves repo contents publicly even when the repo itself is private — a bank
# statement here would be fetchable by anyone who guesses the filename.
# The app never uploads anything, so it does not need a statement committed.
*.pdf

# The expense report template is an internal company document (it carries
# department numbers and GL account lookups). This repo is public, so keep it
# local — the app loads it from your machine at export time and never uploads it.
*.xlsx
*.xls

.DS_Store
node_modules/
